### Quranic Data & Font Attribution / حقوق بيانات وخطوط المصحف الشريف

- The Quranic text (Hafs from Asim) and the Uthmanic font (`KFGQPC Uthmanic Hafs Script`) are provided courtesy of the **King Fahd Complex for the Printing of the Holy Quran** (مجمع الملك فهد لطباعة المصحف الشريف - المدينة المنورة).
- Official website: https://qurancomplex.gov.sa/
- All rights to the Quranic typography and official Hafs data belong to the King Fahd Complex.
